          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao BWANA ukaghamba, “Ngawikua wandu mirongo misanu Sodoma wiko wahachi, nichaghuleka muzi ghose kwa wundu ghwawo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abrahamu ukaghamba, “Nifuye wughoma nidedanye na oho BWANA ini nisefwane kindo chingi, ela ne teri na maivu gheni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welee, wikapungua wasanu kwa awo mirongo misanu wahachi, kuchaghutotesha ugho muzi ghose kwa wundu ghwa awo wasanu wapungua?” Nao ukaghamba, “Iji nawikua mirongo ina na wasanu sichaaghutotesha anduangi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukakotia sena, “Kukawikua mirongo ina ikaia wada?” Nao ukaghamba, “Kwa wundu ghwa awo mirongo ina sichaatotesha kungi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abrahamu ukaghamba, “Nakuvoya kusezamilo BWANA, leka nidede. Welee, kukawikua mirongo idadu ikaia wada?” Nao ukatumbulia, “Kwa wundu ghwa mirongo idadu sichaaghutotesha anduangi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abrahamu ukaghamba, “Nifuye wughoma nidedanye na oho BWANA. Welee, kukawikua mirongo iwi ikaia wada?” Nao ukatumbulia, “Kwa wundu ghwa mirongo iwi sichaaghutotesha anduangi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
